---
export const prerender = true;
import "../styles/global.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>
  TotalSportek Privacy Guidelines | Cookies, Browsing & Information Practices
</title>

<meta
  name="description"
  content="Learn about the privacy practices followed by TotalSportek, including website interactions, cookies, browsing information, security considerations, and general approaches to protecting visitor privacy."
/>

<meta
  name="keywords"
  content="TotalSportek privacy guidelines, TotalSportek privacy information, TotalSportek cookie guidelines, TotalSportek visitor information, TotalSportek browsing privacy, TotalSportek website data, TotalSportek security practices, visitor data guidelines, cookie practices, online privacy information, website privacy standards, TotalSportek privacy details"
/>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />

    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Roboto+Condensed:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body class="bg-[#09090f]">
    <header class="bg-[#131320] border-b border-white/5">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="h-16 flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
          <a
            href="/"
            class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f9fafb] hover:text-purple-400 transition whitespace-nowrap"
          >
            TotalSportek
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 space-y-8">

 <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-7 text-white">
  TotalSportek Privacy Notice | Information, Cookies & Browsing Practices
</h1>

<p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mb-8">
  Effective Date: August 20, 2026
</p>

<div class="space-y-7 text-slate-300 leading-7">


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      About This Privacy Notice
    </h2>

    <p>
      This Privacy Notice describes how TotalSportek approaches information
      connected with visits to the website. It provides general details about
      technical data, browser technologies, third-party services, security
      practices, and choices that may be available to visitors when using
      different parts of the site.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Information Associated With Website Visits
    </h2>

    <p>
      When someone browses TotalSportek, certain technical details may be
      processed as part of normal website operation. Depending on the tools
      and services involved, this can include device characteristics, browser
      settings, operating system details, referring sources, pages viewed,
      general location signals, interaction data, and technical identifiers.
      Information may also be provided directly when a visitor chooses to
      communicate with the website.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Use of Technical Information
    </h2>

    <p>
      Website-related information can help TotalSportek maintain reliable
      functionality, understand how pages are used, identify technical
      problems, improve loading behavior, evaluate site performance, enhance
      navigation, and develop a more consistent experience across browsers,
      screens, and devices.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Browser Storage & Cookies
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek or services integrated with the website may rely on
      cookies, browser storage, pixels, tags, or related technologies.
      Depending on their purpose, these technologies can support essential
      functions, remember preferences, measure performance, understand
      traffic patterns, or assist other website operations. Most modern
      browsers provide controls that allow visitors to review, restrict,
      or remove stored cookies.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Third-Party Technologies
    </h2>

    <p>
      Certain website functions may involve independent providers for
      hosting, analytics, advertising, security, content delivery, or
      performance services. Those providers may handle technical information
      according to their own privacy statements and operating practices.
      Visitors should consult the applicable policies of external services
      when interacting with features provided by third parties.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Protecting Website Operations
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek may use reasonable safeguards intended to support the
      stability and security of its website infrastructure. These measures
      can help reduce risks associated with unauthorized access, misuse,
      technical abuse, or service disruption. Nevertheless, no website,
      network, or internet transmission can be considered completely secure,
      and absolute protection cannot be guaranteed.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Privacy Choices & Applicable Rights
    </h2>

    <p>
      Privacy rights can vary depending on where a visitor resides and which
      laws apply. Where legally available, individuals may have options
      concerning information associated with them, including access,
      correction, removal, limitation, or other applicable requests.
      Appropriate verification may be required before certain requests
      can be considered or completed.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Information Relating to Younger Visitors
    </h2>

    <p>
      TotalSportek is designed as a general-interest sports information
      website. The site does not intentionally request personal information
      from children in situations where applicable regulations prohibit such
      collection. If information is identified as having been submitted
      improperly, reasonable steps may be taken based on the circumstances
      and applicable requirements.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Changes to This Notice
    </h2>

    <p>
      This Privacy Notice may be adjusted from time to time to reflect
      changes in website functionality, technologies, service arrangements,
      information practices, or applicable requirements. Any revised version
      may be published on this page, and the effective date above can be
      updated to indicate when the current version took effect.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div>
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3">
      Privacy Questions & Requests
    </h2>

    <p>
      Visitors who have questions about this Privacy Notice or wish to raise
      a privacy-related matter can contact TotalSportek through the available
      contact channel. Including clear information about the nature of the
      question or request can help ensure that the matter is understood
      correctly.
    </p>

    <a
      href="mailto:support@buffStreamstv.cfd"
      class="inline-flex items-center mt-3 rounded-lg border border-purple-400/20 bg-purple-400/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-purple-300 transition hover:border-purple-300/40 hover:bg-purple-400/10 hover:text-purple-200"
    >
      support@buffStreamstv.cfd
    </a>

  </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>